Original commit body from ff2fee4:

The --tiers flag controlled token budget output files, but was confusing
since --max-tier controls supply chain tier classification. Renamed to
--budgets to clarify:

- --budgets: Token budget output files (4k, 16k, 64k)
- --max-tier: Supply chain tier classification (1-4)

The --tiers flag is kept as a hidden deprecated alias for backward
compatibility. Updated documentation and tests to use new terminology.
